    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "worked": "The factors of 4 on the die are 1, 2 and 4.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{factor of }4)&=\\frac{3}{6}\\\\P(\\text{factor of }4)&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
